OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 5 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAl Ryan introduces a concert
OL,6,     Grecording from Munich of
OL,7,     GCharpentier's Marian mass and
OL,8,     Gbrings us highlights from the
OL,9,     Grecent Belfast International
OL,10,     GFestival of Chamber Music.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,12,     GKate Molleson delves into the
OL,13,     Giconic Fifth Symphony by Jean
OL,14,     GSibelius - and its famed
OL,15,     Gprogrammatic depiction of swans.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GDanny Driver plays live in the
OL,18,     Gstudio and Musical Director of
OL,19,     Gthe Bach Choir, David Hill.
OL,20,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,21,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,22,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
